      "Changelog": "- Better tour scheduling, with more time allowed for travel and rare fish preparation.\n- Tours stay with the current fish more consistently, especially during Intuition and mooch chains.\n- Better handling of closing windows, failed preparation and retries, with clearer reasons for leaving or skipping.\n- Bait checks now account for stock, and trips are planned around upcoming fish windows.\n- Removed the custom wait timer. Waiting now follows the fish’s preparation and availability.\n- Improved preparation and stored bait handling for fish such as Ruby Dragon, Stethacanthus, Sidereal Whale and Rroneek Bichir.\n- Removed unnecessary Angler’s Art building for Great Ball of Lightning and Triple Threat.\n- Adjusted lure timing, hook choices and mooch handling for several rare fish.\n- Clearer messages when holding a collectable, including when it will be accepted automatically.\n- Improved ocean fishing preparation for missing log entries, blue fish and rare targets.\n- Better GP use for ocean achievement goals.\n- Improved spearfishing timing.\n- Better recovery when stuck facing the water or reaching the boat railing after cutscenes.\n- Clearer tour layout with fishing locations, departure times and explanations.\n- Upcoming boats now appear in the tour. The panel stays visible while fishing is paused for the voyage.\n- Added Cancel trip and clearer Auto pick, Auto move and Repeat voyages controls.\n",
